.TH SIASTUB 8
.SH NAME
siastub \- a stand-in for the assistant server (tests only)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B siastub &
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B siastub
serves the port
.B sia
with canned answers sent one word at a time, 30 ms apart, so the
desktop's assistant panel can be tested without a model.
.B "make gui-test"
starts it by hand. A question with "slowly" in it gets a long answer (to
test Stop); any other gets a short one with two actions: a file to open
and the files with an attribute to list.
.PP
If the real assistant already runs, it says so and ends.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sia (1),
.BR siad (4)
